        <item>
            <title>3.1.0</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 24 Jun 2026 00:35:40 +0530</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Deveshb15/aura</link>
            <sparkle:version>27</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.1.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Search inside your documents</h2>
<ul>
  <li><b>Documents are now searchable by their contents.</b> Carpet reads the text out of PDFs, Word, RTF, plain text and code files, so a search matches what's <i>inside</i> a file, not just its name.</li>
  <li><b>New Documents tab.</b> Saved files are sorted by kind — images join the photo grid, audio and video go to Music and Videos, and everything else lands in a dedicated Documents tab instead of Links.</li>
  <li><b>Tidier notch.</b> The recents strip is centered with balanced spacing, and Open App now sits neatly on the right.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
